This project's own source is under the MIT License above. It ships one generated
file, `lib/client.vendor.js`, which bundles other MIT-licensed software:

  * three.js                (c) 2010-2025 three.js authors      MIT
  * @pixiv/three-vrm        (c) pixiv Inc.                      MIT
