(@moeru/three-mmd and mmd-parser were bundled until 2026-10-12, when this project
became VRM-only and the MMD stack left both the chunk and `vendor/package.json`.)

Their license texts are preserved inline in that file's banner and comments.

It also ships ONE 3D model file, `assets/models/SampleModel.vrm`, whose own
embedded metadata allows redistribution, modification and commercial use with no
attribution required — see `assets/models/README.md`, and `check-docs.mjs` asserts
those terms on the committed bytes. Every other model is supplied by the user and
remains under its own author's terms.
